      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "Folders"
        ],
        "summary": "Delete Folder",
        "description": "The API also supports **If-Match** optional header to provide the versionId, so you can verify you are working on the latest version. (applicable for single file upload, ignored for multiple file upload)\n\nIf versionId provided in the **If-Match** header is not latest, error Response wiith Response code **412** will be send back to the caller with **Errorcode** INVALID_HEADER &\n**Error Message**: If-Match header value is not latest versionId.\n\nIf the **If-Match** header value is *  or header not provided, actions will be performed on the latest version.",
        "operationId": "DeleteFolder",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "folderId",
            "in": "path",
