    "/projects/{projectId}/settings": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Projects"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Project settings",
        "description": "API to List all the project specific settings.",
        "operationId": "GetProjectsettings",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "projectId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Path parameter. ID of the project",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "woC32em2Fb0"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "filter",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "Setting filter. All project settings will be given if not provided.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "sync",
                "notifications",
                "unit"
              ],
              "example": "sync"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "headers": {},
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GetProjectSettingsResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Projects"
        ],
        "summary": "Update Project Settings",
        "description": "This API will set all settings related to project. Generally sets sync,notifications,unit settings. \"ALLOW_AUTO_CHECKOUT\" is the default value in case if sync mode is not given in sync settings.\n\n**Unit Settings :**  \nAPI allows to reset all the values to metric/imperial/USSurveyFeet if unitsystem is the only attribute in the api Request. Custom unit system allows setting mix and match values.\n\neg: \"unitSettings\": {\n        \"unitsystem\": \"metric\u201d\n      }\n\n**Acceptable values for unitsettings :**\n\n<p>Decimal precisions - (0, 0.1, 0.01, 0.001, 0.0001, 0.00001, 0.000001, 0.0000001, 0.00000001)<br>\nFractional precisions -(1/2,1/4,1/8,1/16,1/32,1/64)<br></p>\n\nunitsystem - (metric, imperial, USSurveyFeet, custom)\n<p align=\"right\"><i>Defaults are in bold</i></p>\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td></td>\n    <th>metric</th>\n    <th>imperial</th>\n    <th>USSurveyFeet</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>lengthunit</td>\n    <td><b>mm</b> - <b>0</b>\n    <br/>cm - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>m - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>km  - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td><b>in</b> - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>ft-in - <b>1/4</b>\n    <br/>ft - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>yd - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>mi - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>usft - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>sIN - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/><b>sFT</b> - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>sYD - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>sMI - <b>0.001</b></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>lengthmeasurementunit</td>\n    <td><b>mm</b> - <b>0</b>\n    <br/>cm - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>m - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>km - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td><b>in</b> - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>ft-in - <b>1/4</b>\n    <br/>ft - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>yd - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>mi - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>sIN - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/><b>sFT</b> - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>sYD - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>sMI - <b>0.001</b></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>areaunit</td>\n    <td>mm2 - <b>0</b>\n    <br/>cm2 - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/><b>m2</b> - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>ha - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>in2 - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/><b>ft2</b> - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>yd2 - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>ac - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>mi2 - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>usft2 - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>usyd2 - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>in2 - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/><b>ft2</b> - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>yd2 - <b>0.001</b></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>volumeunit</td>\n    <td>mm3 - <b>0</b>\n    <br/>cm3 - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/><b>m3</b> - <b>0.01</b></td>\n    <td>in3 - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>ft3 - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/><b>yd3</b> - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>usft3 - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>usyd3 - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>acft - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>usacft - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>in3 - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>ft3 - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/><b>yd3</b> - <b>0.001</b></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>weightunit</td>\n    <td>mg - <b>0</b>\n    <br/>g - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>kg - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/><b>t</b> - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>oz - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>lb - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/><b>ton</b> - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>stone - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td>oz - <b>0.1</b>\n    <br/>lb - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/><b>ton</b> - <b>0.001</b></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>angularunit</td>\n    <td><b>deg</b> - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>rad - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>deg-min-sec - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td><b>deg</b> - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>rad - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>deg-min-sec - <b>0.001</b></td>\n    <td><b>deg</b> - <b>0.001</b>\n    <br/>rad - <b>0.01</b>\n    <br/>deg-min-sec - <b>0.001</b></td>\n  </tr> \n</table>",
        "operationId": "UpdateProjectSettings",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "projectId",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "ID of the project.",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "woC32em2Fb0"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "description": "",
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UpdateProjectSettingsRequest"
              },
              "example": {
                "syncSettings": {
                  "projectId": "C0EvPWvH8vR",
                  "syncMode": "ALLOW_AUTO_CHECKOUT",
                  "filters": [
                    {
                      "id": "Dyfw481f270",
                      "description": "AutoCAD lock files (DWL)",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "pNCBBwArq-g",
                      "description": "AutoCAD lock files (DWL2)",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "cu2mUJnneTc",
                      "description": "Rhino lock files (RHL)",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "eX9gwJqSe8I",
                      "description": "Rhino, etc. backup files (BAK)",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "R5yGCjROSRE",
                      "description": "Revit backup directory",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "3UUWLWca4SQ",
                      "description": "Revit temp directory",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "q2I7dwDWrnM",
                      "description": "Revit backup file",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "0CGhTWXE3A4",
                      "description": "Windows shortcut",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "nj7Glv-AqV0",
                      "description": "Log Files",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "M-dWujJNQXA",
                      "description": "AutoCAD lisp file",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "AgR8A8wJDr8",
                      "description": "Sketchup backup file",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "CJY2c8y0EUo",
                      "description": "Error file",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "1rNbvWZv264",
                      "description": "Rhino backup file",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "bFvr4Jk8dqw",
                      "description": "Thumbs.db",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "OnkRKjL4264",
                      "description": "backup directory",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "Xzh3AJfmcZY",
                      "description": "log directory",
                      "checked": true
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "LVWcSjGiPuU",
                      "description": "Temp files",
                      "checked": true
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "unitSettings": {
                  "unitsystem": "metric",
                  "lengthunit": "mm",
                  "lengthunitformat": "0",
                  "lengthmeasurementunit": "mm",
                  "lengthmeasurementunitformat": "0",
                  "areaunit": "m2",
                  "areaunitformat": "0.01",
                  "volumeunit": "m3",
                  "volumeunitformat": "0.01",
                  "weightunit": "t",
                  "weightunitformat": "0.001",
                  "angularunit": "deg",
                  "angularunitformat": "0.001"
                },
                "notificationSettings": {
                  "projectId": "C0EvPWvH8vR",
                  "allowUserSettings": false,
                  "dailyDigestTimeZone": {
                    "dailyDigestTime": "2016-10-01T09:00:00+0530",
                    "id": "l60MJv7V264",
                    "label": "(UTC+00:00) Coordinated Universal Time"
                  },
                  "notificationSettings": {
                    "files": [
                      {
                        "instantNotification": true,
