    {
      "name": "Object Link to Entity",
      "description": "API related to 3d model object linkage to entity.\nObject link is a relationship between a 3d model (source) and a Trimble Connect entity or some external reference (target).  The linked entity (target) could be a file, a TODO, a view, a clash item, or some external reference url.  Moreover, the source object may contain additional information regarding the semantic of the link; for example, various 3d model object could be included in the source to provide linking of 3d model objects to target."
